                      <p class="text wb-box reveal wb-statement__line wb-statement__line--2">the unanswered.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="wb-statement__body">
                      <h2 id="statement-title" class="reveal wb-statement__title">答えのない問いを、<br />つくることで確かめる。</h2>
                      <p class="reveal wb-statement__ja">WONDER BROTHERSは、まだ答えのない課題やアイデアを形にして試し、そこで得た事実を次の判断につなげるデザインスタジオです。</p>
                      <p class="reveal wb-statement__ja">構想を議論だけで終わらせず、サービスや体験、プロトタイプとして実際に確かめます。目的は完成させることではなく、本番へ進むか、方向を変えるか、止めるかを判断できる状態にすることです。</p>
                      <p class="reveal wb-statement__en" lang="en">WONDER BROTHERS is a design studio that turns unanswered questions and early ideas into something that can be tested in the real world.</p>
                      <p class="reveal wb-statement__en" lang="en">We shape ideas into services, experiences, and prototypes, then learn from how people respond. The goal is not simply to build, but to gather enough evidence to decide what should happen next.</p>
                      <p class="reveal wb-principle">
                        <span class="wb-principle__en" lang="en">DISCOVER. MAKE. LEARN.</span>
                        <span class="wb-principle__ja">見つける。つくる。学ぶ。</span>
                      </p>
                    </div>
                  </section>
                </div>

                <div class="wb-box reveal wb-lower">
                  <!-- ============ 02 APPROACH ============ -->
                  <section id="approach" class="wb-sec wb-flow" aria-labelledby="approach-title">
                    <div class="wb-sec__inner">
                      <div class="wb-sec__head">
                        <h2 id="approach-title" class="reveal wb-display wb-display--approach" lang="en">APPROACH</h2>
                        <p class="reveal wb-sec__sub" lang="en">We think by making.</p>
                      </div>
                      <div class="wb-sec__lead">
                        <p class="reveal wb-sec__heading">考えるだけで終わらせない。</p>
                        <div class="reveal wb-sec__text">
                          <p>新しいサービスやプロダクトに、最初から正解があることはほとんどありません。まず人や状況を観察して何がまだ分かっていないのかを整理し、そこから立てた仮説を必要な範囲だけ形にして、実際の反応や結果で確かめます。</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="reveal wb-sec__text-en" lang="en">
                          <p>New services and products rarely begin with a clear answer. We start by observing people, systems, and situations to understand what is still uncertain. From there, we form a hypothesis, build only what is needed to test it, and learn from real behavior and outcomes.</p>
                        </div>
                      </div>
                      <ol class="wb-dml">
