                        </p>
                        <p class="wb-cycle__ja">学んだことを、次の判断につなげる。</p>
                        <p class="wb-cycle__en" lang="en">What we learn leads to the next decision.</p>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                  </section>

                  <!-- ============ 03 CLIENT WORK ============ -->
