                        <p class="wb-row-sec__ja">たとえば、次のような段階からご相談いただけます。</p>
                        <ul class="wb-consult">
                          {consultCases.map((c) => (
                            <li class="wb-consult__item">
                              <p class="wb-consult__ja">{c.ja}</p>
                              <p class="wb-consult__en" lang="en">{c.en}</p>
                            </li>
                          ))}
                        </ul>
                        <p class="wb-row-sec__ja">問いと仮説を整理し、必要であれば小さくつくって試しながら、次の判断ができるところまで一緒に進めます。</p>
                        <p class="wb-row-sec__en" lang="en">You don't need a fully defined project to get in touch. We help clarify the question, define the hypothesis, test what matters, and build enough evidence to make the next decision.</p>
                        <a href="/contact/" class="link wb-box wb-company__contact"
                          ><div class="wb-box wb-company__contact-text">
